abstract: >
  An automated high-precision instance segmentation, fine-grained morphology classification,
  and demographic census system developed for the endangered Black-faced Spoonbill (Platalea minor).
  The platform integrates YOLO11/YOLOv12 deep neural architectures with Sliced Aided Hyper Inference (SAHI),
  P3-stage Coordinate Attention (BeakAttention @ P3), and a deterministic cross-platform desktop studio
  with non-destructive floating HUD telemetry supporting Windows 10/11, macOS (Apple Silicon & Intel), and Linux.
